  "title": "LG Dryer",
  "revisionid": 1480045,
  "contents_raw": "== Background ==\n\nLG Electronics was established in 1958 as GoldStar. The company first produced TVs and radios and eventually began to produce home appliances such as refrigerators, washing machines, and dryers. Today dryers are equipped with TurboSteam technology.\n\n== Identification ==\n\nThe model number can be found inside the dryer, around the drum. Common LG dryer models include the DLE3500W, DLEX3700W, and DLGX3701W.\n\n== Additional Information ==\n\n* [link|https://www.lg.com/us/support/help-library/find-my-lg-model-and-serial-number--20152254906058|LG Washing Machine Model Number Lookup]\n* [link|https://www.lg.com/us/support/manuals-documents|LG Owner's Manuals]\n* ***LG Customer Support Phone Number***: 1-800-243-0000",
